---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="home">
  <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
    <div class="text-xl py-1">Welcome to Faithful Craftsmen 👋</div>
    <div class="text-5xl font-bold">A Family Workshop</div>
    <div class="text-3xl py-3 font-bold">Handcrafted Projects & Stories</div>
    <div class="py-2">
      <span class="text-lg">
        We are a small family shop—Dad and three sons—working together to build, create, and learn. Here you’ll find a collection of our current and past projects, stories from our workshop, and a glimpse into our lives as makers. We believe in quality, creativity, and the joy of working side by side as a family.
        <br/><br/>
        Join us on this blessed journey as we carve out a life rich in faith, family, and the beautiful art of woodworking. We welcome you to our virtual workshop—may it warm your heart and inspire your spirit as much as it does ours.
        <br/><br/>
        Explore our projects, read about our journey, and feel free to reach out if you’d like to connect or have something custom in mind. In the future, you’ll be able to order our handcrafted items right here!
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@faithfulcraftsmen.com">Contact Us</a>
      <!-- You can add more buttons or links here as needed -->
    </div>
    <!-- TODO: Add a beautiful family/shop branding image here -->
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
